    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d136">

                <pb facs="0241" n="135" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg135"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Egan to Mr.
                            Blaine</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-06-09"><hi rendition="#italic">June 9,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Egan states that, while the revolutionists were not inclined to make any
                    reasonable peace propositions, the Chilean Government is well disposed to
                    entertain any that might be made.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
